# Build-context filter for services/developer-platform/Dockerfile (context: repository root).
*
!packages/service-auth
!packages/usage-facts
!packages/webhooks
!packages/contracts/platform-developer
!services/developer-platform

**/target
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.secret
**/*.log
services/developer-platform/Dockerfile
services/developer-platform/Dockerfile.dockerignore
